  "name": "Blue Spirit's Soul-Gaze",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/BlueSpirit_Path_Icon.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 spaces</p><p>You look upon another's soul and see the truth of who they are.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>10 spaces </strong>of you and make a <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check resisted by the target’s <strong>Willpower</strong>.</p><p>If you succeed, you may choose to learn one of the following pieces of information per difference in successes.</p><ul><li><p>What type of creature they are.</p></li><li><p>One of their short-term goals.</p></li><li><p>One of their long-term goals.</p></li><li><p>Their greatest fear.</p></li><li><p>Their greatest love.</p></li><li><p>Their current <strong>Stamina</strong>.</p></li><li><p>A secret about them.</p></li><li><p>Which of their skills has the highest <strong>Training</strong> or <strong>Expertise</strong>.</p></li><li><p>An <strong>Ability</strong> they have.</p></li><li><p>If they have <strong>Resolve</strong>, and if so, how much.</p></li></ul><p>Once you have Soul-Gazed a creature, you cannot do so again until you complete a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</p>",
